      "answer": "For a multimodal model such as Google’s `gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview`, call `generateText` and read the generated images from the response’s `files` property. [1: \"you can access the generated images using the `files` property of the response.\"] Iterate over `result.files` and select entries whose `mediaType` starts with `image/`. [1: \"if (file.mediaType.startsWith('image/'))\"]\n\nEach file provides image data as a base64 string in `file.base64` or binary data in `file.uint8Array`, along with its media type. [1: \"Access images as base64 string, Uint8Array binary data, or check type\"]",
